## Harness shape

Added an ignored integration test at:
    apps/wifimic_server/tests/lan_audio_acceptance.rs

Supporting test-only modules remain inside `apps/wifimic_server/tests/lan_audio_acceptance/`.
The harness is not a workspace member, is ignored by default, uses bounded SSH options, binds
the real Windows source `192.168.0.200`, sends `encode_control(Start { session_id })` to
`192.168.0.210:6902`, decodes the real response, and sends an acknowledged Stop through an
RAII cleanup guard. It only reads firewall/service state and never installs rules or restarts
the service.

